My uses for undead turning:  During an extinctionist game, to revive
monsters that can only be created with a cursed scroll of genocide
(cf. woodchucks and minotaurs) and not with a scroll/spell/wand of
create monster.  When killing a dragon whose scales I *really* need. 
The down side is that you have a 1/3 chance of finding scales on a
dead dragon, but only 1/20 if the dragon is resurrected and re-killed!

Chaotics have the chance to pacify the undead, based on their XL. 
They can pacify zombies if their XL is equal to or greater than the
zombie's level, or liches, ghosts, vampires, wraiths, and mummies if
their XL is at least 2 greater than the undead's level.  Not that
useful to me... YMMV.

